CASE D17 unsupported-preferences-pack-and-field
source TextWireExperimentBlueprint.md:27; UserPreferencesCodec.kt
kind preferences
given two isolated mutations of D11: target="xx" native="yy"; unknown field with unconvertible value
expect RecoveryRequired on each, no fallback to active pack/defaults
