END

CASE D18 unknown-legacy-value-cannot-be-losslessly-typed
source TextWireDesign.md:57; TextWireExperimentBlueprint.md:27
kind progress
given unknown legacy value that cannot map losslessly to ordered typed tree, e.g. duplicate source object keys already collapsed by legacy parser
expect RecoveryRequired; preserve original legacy bytes; do not emit new text or discard the value
wire A/B/C NOT FROZEN
END

